<title>GERMANY: German grain trade seeks intvn barley export.</title>
<headline>German grain trade seeks intvn barley export.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders applied for the export of 14,000 tonnes of barley from intervention stores to third countries, grain intervention board BLE said.</p>
<p>BLE received no other applications for intervention grain exports at today's weekly EU grain export tender.</p>
<p>-- Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
